# Leave Her, Johnny: traditional sea shanty, text after Whall (1910).
{title: Leave Her, Johnny}
{composer: Traditional (sea shanty)}
{key: G}
{tempo: 108}
{time: 3/4}
{x_level: 1}
{x_strum: D - D - D -}

{comment: One down per beat to start; later try D - D U D U.}

